WEBVTT

00:00:01.160 --> 00:00:02.490
Chara-su!

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:05.740
Everyone is shugo-shugo-peppy
again today!

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:08.440
It's time to start Shugo
Chara Party!

00:00:08.440 --> 00:00:10.200
Let's enjoy it together!

00:00:10.200 --> 00:00:11.750
Everyone's hearts:

00:00:11.750 --> 00:00:13.050
Unlock!

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:15.550
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:17.130 --> 00:00:19.060
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:22.860
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:24.730
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:24.730 --> 00:00:26.580
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:28.460
you're like a dream.

00:00:28.460 --> 00:00:30.310
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:30.310 --> 00:00:32.200
You may be so sweet girl

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:34.040
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:00:34.040 --> 00:00:35.840
it's like I'm dreaming.

00:00:35.840 --> 00:00:39.640
Whenever I start something new

00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:43.350
I get really excited,

00:00:43.350 --> 00:00:47.020
though I pretend like it's nothing at all.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:50.160
I've always been stubborn like that.

00:00:50.160 --> 00:00:57.800
I think it'd be nice if I could
just be honest with myself.

00:00:57.800 --> 00:01:01.590
But it's hard, you know?

00:01:01.590 --> 00:01:05.720
I'll try working on it bit by bit.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:10.340
It's party time!

00:01:10.340 --> 00:01:14.090
Someday I'll transform into someone brand new.

00:01:14.090 --> 00:01:17.830
But for now, I want to forget everything else

00:01:17.830 --> 00:01:22.030
and discover all of the potential in me.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.240
It's party time!

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:28.950
That brand new me is out there somewhere.

00:01:28.950 --> 00:01:32.460
But for now, I just want to stay as I am

00:01:32.460 --> 00:01:37.090
and find all of the things I can be.

00:01:37.090 --> 00:01:39.050
Pa pa ya pa pa pa pia

00:01:46.150 --> 00:01:48.790
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:51.430
"It's a Yoru Christmas!"

00:01:59.300 --> 00:02:02.100
Today's Christmas, it's so fun!

00:02:02.340 --> 00:02:03.290
Throw a party!

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.170
Eat a cake!

00:02:04.170 --> 00:02:05.390
And get presents!

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:07.710
Christmas, bah humbug-nya!

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.810
You're all frolicking around
like idiots-nya!

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.010
I'm not an idiot!

00:02:11.010 --> 00:02:13.350
And neither am I!

00:02:13.350 --> 00:02:16.310
Don't be such a grinch
and help us out.

00:02:16.310 --> 00:02:18.570
Well, if you insist-nya...

00:02:19.440 --> 00:02:21.920
It's a niboshi tree-nya!

00:02:22.920 --> 00:02:24.690
What do you think you're doing?

00:02:24.690 --> 00:02:28.830
If you keep doing these sorts of things,
Santa won't put you on his "nice" list!

00:02:29.140 --> 00:02:31.200
And that means no presents.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:34.710
I-I don't care whether Santa
gives me anything-nya...

00:02:35.830 --> 00:02:39.010
There's no way he actually
exists anyway-nya.

00:02:39.970 --> 00:02:43.600
What jerk threw this out here?

00:02:50.040 --> 00:02:53.770
I-It's not like I'm trying to suck
up to Santa or anything-nya.

00:02:58.120 --> 00:02:58.860
Now's my chance-nya.

00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:02.880
Phew, cleaned it all up-nya.

00:03:02.880 --> 00:03:04.910
I feel kind of refreshed-nya.

00:03:13.970 --> 00:03:15.690
Snow-nya?

00:03:15.690 --> 00:03:19.500
Santa gave me snow
for my present-nya!

00:03:19.500 --> 00:03:21.080
Yoru!

00:03:21.600 --> 00:03:24.930
We're sorry for being
mean to you before.

00:03:24.930 --> 00:03:27.250
We're starting the
Christmas party.

00:03:27.250 --> 00:03:29.140
Enough about that...

00:03:29.140 --> 00:03:32.720
Santa came and made
it snow as a present!

00:03:32.720 --> 00:03:34.120
Santa did?

00:03:34.780 --> 00:03:35.770
Look!

00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:41.630
Okay, let's go back to
the Royal Garden!

00:03:41.630 --> 00:03:43.990
We have a delicious cake!

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.180
I'm tellin' the truth-nya!

00:03:45.180 --> 00:03:46.620
I really saw him-nya!

00:03:46.930 --> 00:03:49.300
For real-nya!

00:03:55.400 --> 00:03:57.000
Dia!

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.660
Are you coming?

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.030
Coming!

00:04:07.870 --> 00:04:11.780
"To be continued"

00:04:13.010 --> 00:04:16.160
Shugo Chara Encyclopedia!
Character Introductions!

00:04:16.160 --> 00:04:18.080
The first person we'll
introduce today is...

00:04:18.690 --> 00:04:20.110
Tsukiyomi Ikuto!

00:04:23.030 --> 00:04:26.870
Ikuto was involved in the battle
for the Embryo, got his freedom,

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:29.770
and has now left on a journey
to search for his father.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:32.760
What ever happened to the love
between him and Amu-chan?

00:04:32.760 --> 00:04:34.970
I sure hope he comes back soon!

00:04:47.210 --> 00:04:49.670
Continuing on, the second person
we'll introduce is...

00:04:51.210 --> 00:04:53.000
Hoshina Utau!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:58.060
Utau-chan is a super
popular idol singer!

00:04:58.060 --> 00:05:01.900
She sings wonderful songs
that cheer everyone up!

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:06.440
She's Ikuto's little sister, and she loves
her older brother a <i>whole</i> lot.

00:05:15.070 --> 00:05:18.000
We'll continue with
these each week!

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:20.520
Look forward to it!

00:05:22.570 --> 00:05:26.250
Shugo-shugo Open Heart Game!

00:05:26.250 --> 00:05:31.470
Today we're going to be doing another personality
quiz that'll find out who you really are inside!

00:05:33.040 --> 00:05:35.850
Everyone watching at home,
you play along!

00:05:35.850 --> 00:05:37.350
Here's the question:

00:05:37.350 --> 00:05:40.960
Which girl do you look up to?

00:05:40.960 --> 00:05:43.200
Choose from these four.

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.600
We'll start with Spade...

00:05:46.600 --> 00:05:48.420
I choose Yaya-chan!

00:05:48.420 --> 00:05:49.570
And you, Diamond?

00:05:49.570 --> 00:05:51.020
Rima-chan.

00:05:51.020 --> 00:05:51.940
Heart?

00:05:51.940 --> 00:05:53.270
I also choose Rima-chan.

00:05:53.270 --> 00:05:54.470
And Clover?

00:05:54.470 --> 00:05:55.570
Amu-chan.

00:05:56.880 --> 00:06:00.160
Excellent... I think these'll
be spot on.

00:06:01.660 --> 00:06:04.530
Did everyone watching
at home pick one?

00:06:07.590 --> 00:06:10.420
Then, it's time to announce
the results!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:13.990
What we'll find out today is...

00:06:13.990 --> 00:06:16.140
Your weak point!

00:06:16.140 --> 00:06:17.940
That's "jakuten" in Japanese!

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:22.280
If you chose Amu, then you
tend to get flustered!

00:06:22.280 --> 00:06:23.610
Stay calm, 'kay?

00:06:23.610 --> 00:06:24.730
Was it right?

00:06:24.730 --> 00:06:25.940
Yes, that's right.

00:06:25.940 --> 00:06:27.650
Definitely.

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:29.090
No kidding.

00:06:29.610 --> 00:06:34.510
Next, if you chose Yaya, then you're forgetful
and have a short attention span.

00:06:34.510 --> 00:06:35.830
Was it right?

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.310
No, it's not.

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:38.130
Sure it is.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:39.140
No, I'm not.

00:06:39.140 --> 00:06:40.320
You're totally forgetful.

00:06:40.320 --> 00:06:41.480
No way.

00:06:42.240 --> 00:06:45.840
And if you chose Rima,
then you cry easily.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.310
When do you cry, Diamond?

00:06:48.710 --> 00:06:53.130
When people get angry at me, or when
something is really moving.

00:06:53.130 --> 00:06:54.890
Or when I get embarrassed...

00:06:54.890 --> 00:06:55.750
I see.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:56.470
And what about Heart?

00:06:56.730 --> 00:07:01.340
When I can't do a dance, I'll
cry out of frustration.

00:07:01.340 --> 00:07:03.080
I see.

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:07.020
And finally, for those of you at home
who chose Nadeshiko...

00:07:07.020 --> 00:07:10.320
You're not good at refusing people
or saying difficult things.

00:07:10.320 --> 00:07:11.780
Was it right?

00:07:13.550 --> 00:07:14.720
Okay!

00:07:14.720 --> 00:07:18.650
We learned that Heart and Diamond
are cry-babies today!

00:07:18.650 --> 00:07:21.030
What did you think, everyone?

00:07:21.030 --> 00:07:25.460
Until the next Shugo-shugo
Open Heart Game!

00:07:32.230 --> 00:07:34.570
Shugo Chara Pucchi Puchi!

00:07:34.570 --> 00:07:37.430
"The Christmas Cake's
in Trouble!"

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.660
A splendid cake, I see!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:44.350
Amu-chan and the others
prepared it.

00:07:44.350 --> 00:07:47.200
They wanted everyone to enjoy
Christmas together.

00:07:47.200 --> 00:07:48.800
Well then, without further ado...

00:07:48.800 --> 00:07:50.960
Merry Christmas and...

00:07:50.960 --> 00:07:53.190
Let's Eat!

00:07:56.460 --> 00:07:59.430
What a high quality sweetness!

00:07:59.430 --> 00:08:01.990
Look, all of us are here!

00:08:01.990 --> 00:08:04.000
They made us all out of candy!

00:08:04.000 --> 00:08:04.990
Indeed.

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.300
'tis simple, but definitely
has that Kingly air to it!

00:08:11.360 --> 00:08:12.990
Taste's okay, too-nya.

00:08:12.990 --> 00:08:15.690
Yoru, how dare you eat the King!

00:08:15.690 --> 00:08:17.280
Wait!

00:08:17.280 --> 00:08:20.010
Kiseki, just let it go.

00:08:20.010 --> 00:08:22.640
Yes, we should all get along
and enjoy the party.

00:08:25.100 --> 00:08:26.740
Hey, Yoru!

00:08:26.740 --> 00:08:28.830
Wait right there!

00:08:28.830 --> 00:08:31.460
I already got my present
from Santa-nya!

00:08:31.460 --> 00:08:33.740
I can play pranks to my
heart's content-nya!

00:08:36.620 --> 00:08:39.030
He went into the cake!

00:08:44.710 --> 00:08:45.830
Yum-nya!

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.010
Yoru!

00:08:47.010 --> 00:08:48.080
This cake is the best-nya!

00:08:48.080 --> 00:08:49.070
Knave!

00:08:49.070 --> 00:08:50.380
Over here-nya!

00:08:49.900 --> 00:08:51.250
Halt!

00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:54.190
The cake's full of holes...

00:08:57.080 --> 00:09:00.290
Christmas parties sure
are fun-nya.

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:05.060
But I ate too much sweets and
now I don't feel so good-nya.

00:09:06.520 --> 00:09:11.530
Ruining the cake is <i>not allowed</i>.

00:09:12.690 --> 00:09:15.930
You'd better get out of
there and apologize.

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:19.530
Even we can't stop Su
when she gets angry.

00:09:21.390 --> 00:09:23.290
Fine, I understand-nya.

00:09:28.150 --> 00:09:29.080
What's the matter?

00:09:29.080 --> 00:09:30.170
It isn't...

00:09:31.470 --> 00:09:34.200
My stomach's stuck and
I can't get out-nya!

00:09:34.200 --> 00:09:36.730
I ate too much cake-nya!

00:09:41.100 --> 00:09:43.440
Please give me some tea-nya.

00:09:43.440 --> 00:09:45.130
I'm thirsty-nya!

00:09:45.130 --> 00:09:47.670
Then just come over here.

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:50.870
Can't you just eat your way out?

00:09:50.870 --> 00:09:54.330
I can't eat any more-nya!

00:09:55.550 --> 00:09:57.910
See you again!

00:09:58.640 --> 00:10:02.160
Coming up next is
Shugo Chara Dokki Doki!

00:10:02.160 --> 00:10:06.000
Today's episode is
"I'm Beat! Amu-chan becomes a Mom?"

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.060
Amu-chan becomes...

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.810
...a mom?

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:11.350
What could that mean?!

00:10:24.570 --> 00:10:28.150
What's really important?

00:10:29.410 --> 00:10:34.200
Well, it's white and round and sunny,

00:10:34.200 --> 00:10:41.460
and even if they don't know it,
everyone has one in their heart.

00:10:42.740 --> 00:10:52.800
The faith I have in others is what keeps me going.

00:10:52.800 --> 00:10:57.520
Guardian Eggs and X Eggs, Guardian
Characters and X Characters...

00:10:57.520 --> 00:11:01.890
They're all precious things.

00:11:01.890 --> 00:11:06.060
And so, Open Heart, go!

00:11:06.060 --> 00:11:07.590
Everything'll be okay.

00:11:07.590 --> 00:11:10.650
Because even if you feel lost,

00:11:10.650 --> 00:11:14.080
you're not alone.

00:11:14.080 --> 00:11:16.240
We'll always be together.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:18.880
And when I think of that, somehow,

00:11:18.880 --> 00:11:21.910
I feel warm and fuzzy inside.

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.090
Open Heart, now!

00:11:25.090 --> 00:11:26.750
You can see the eggs, right?

00:11:26.750 --> 00:11:31.760
They're smiling and bouncing around.

00:11:31.760 --> 00:11:37.600
So from now on, forever and ever...

00:11:37.600 --> 00:11:39.820
I'll be counting on you!

00:11:44.470 --> 00:11:46.150
Let's play, Amu-chan!

00:11:46.150 --> 00:11:47.450
Today's Sunday!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:49.780
It's beautiful weather outside!

00:11:49.780 --> 00:11:51.900
How about you invite Tadase-kun
out on a date?

00:11:51.900 --> 00:11:53.100
I can't.

00:11:56.200 --> 00:11:59.190
I have to finish this homework.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:01.770
Not a chance.

00:12:01.770 --> 00:12:04.210
This is what you get for not
doing a little every day.

00:12:04.210 --> 00:12:05.450
She can't go out and play.

00:12:05.450 --> 00:12:07.530
And it's finally Sunday!

00:12:07.530 --> 00:12:10.480
Impossible or not, I have to do it.

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:14.300
But can I really finish it in a day?

00:12:14.300 --> 00:12:16.910
Amu-chan, breakfast!

00:12:16.910 --> 00:12:18.450
Coming!

00:12:18.450 --> 00:12:20.820
Huh? You've got to go to work?

00:12:20.820 --> 00:12:23.920
I'm really busy with this photo
exhibition coming up...

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:26.680
And I had an interview come
up last minute...

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:31.230
It's finally Sunday, and I have to
be apart from you! I'm so sad!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.150
So that's that, Amu-chan.

00:12:33.150 --> 00:12:36.160
Please take care of Ami-chan
today, okay?

00:12:36.160 --> 00:12:37.800
Wait, I have home-

00:12:37.800 --> 00:12:38.820
Yay!

00:12:38.820 --> 00:12:40.650
Hanging out with Sis!

00:12:40.650 --> 00:12:42.150
I have home-

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:44.430
And don't forget about
cleaning and laundry!

00:12:44.430 --> 00:12:45.570
I have...

00:12:45.790 --> 00:12:47.530
Okay then, the rest is up to you!

00:12:47.530 --> 00:12:50.060
You're not listening to what I'm-

00:12:50.060 --> 00:12:53.860
I'm Beat! Amu-chan
becomes a Mom?

00:12:50.330 --> 00:12:53.860
See you later,
Mom and Dad!

00:12:54.330 --> 00:12:57.730
Looking after Ami-chan,
cleaning, and laundry...

00:12:58.540 --> 00:13:01.240
It's Amu-chan's entrance into
the realm of motherhood.

00:13:01.240 --> 00:13:02.980
Amu-chan, we've got a problem!

00:13:05.150 --> 00:13:06.840
What the heck is this?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:12.570
Sis, play with me!

00:13:13.080 --> 00:13:17.300
Mother Amu-chan, why don't we
start by cleaning up a bit?

00:13:17.300 --> 00:13:18.760
I have no choice...

00:13:19.450 --> 00:13:21.660
Just do it!

00:13:22.570 --> 00:13:25.360
Fight, fight, Amu-chan!

00:13:25.360 --> 00:13:27.900
You can do it, you can
do it, Amu-chan!

00:13:27.900 --> 00:13:30.290
Fight, fight, Amu-chan!

00:13:30.290 --> 00:13:33.200
You can do it, you can
do it, Amu-chan!

00:13:33.200 --> 00:13:35.120
Let's play, Sis!

00:13:35.120 --> 00:13:36.430
I can't.

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.830
I'm very busy right now.

00:13:39.370 --> 00:13:41.280
I'm bored.

00:13:42.440 --> 00:13:43.920
And that's it for the laundry.

00:13:44.410 --> 00:13:46.920
Next is my homework.

00:13:46.920 --> 00:13:48.660
As if...

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:51.100
Over this way, Dia-chan!

00:13:51.390 --> 00:13:54.760
Ami! What are you doing
in my room?

00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:56.760
I'm playing cameraman.

00:13:56.760 --> 00:14:01.610
You wouldn't play with me, so I got your super
Characters to play with me instead.

00:14:02.760 --> 00:14:05.900
If you're going to play, then
do it in your own room!

00:14:05.540 --> 00:14:06.940
<i>Growl~</i>

00:14:07.380 --> 00:14:10.950
Sis, I'm hungry.

00:14:12.970 --> 00:14:14.890
Lunch, huh?

00:14:14.890 --> 00:14:16.290
What am I going to do?

00:14:16.290 --> 00:14:17.620
Hurry up!

00:14:17.880 --> 00:14:21.800
Amu-chan, just Character
Change with me.

00:14:21.800 --> 00:14:23.210
Oh, yeah!

00:14:23.210 --> 00:14:24.630
Character Change!

00:14:25.420 --> 00:14:28.680
Let's Lovely Cooking!

00:14:37.110 --> 00:14:40.730
One salisbury steak, finished!

00:14:40.730 --> 00:14:42.360
Yay!

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.940
Let's eat!

00:14:49.180 --> 00:14:51.010
How is it, Ami?

00:14:52.000 --> 00:14:54.500
Not as good as Mom's.

00:14:57.080 --> 00:14:59.210
Well, I did my best...

00:14:59.210 --> 00:15:00.810
I'm shocked!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:05.320
I must go on a journey
of self discovery!

00:15:05.320 --> 00:15:07.460
It's not that big a deal.

00:15:09.220 --> 00:15:11.200
Gotta concentrate, gotta
concentrate...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:14.010
Wow! Dia-chan, you're amazing!

00:15:14.210 --> 00:15:17.480
I can't concentrate like this!

00:15:17.480 --> 00:15:20.050
Play all you want, just
do it outside!

00:15:20.050 --> 00:15:23.350
Then, let's all play outside,
everyone!

00:15:23.350 --> 00:15:24.730
Yeah!

00:15:31.130 --> 00:15:33.160
Next time...

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:40.570
Why am I here?

00:15:40.570 --> 00:15:42.890
Because you're the mom.

00:15:42.890 --> 00:15:45.820
I don't have time for this!

00:15:46.300 --> 00:15:47.310
Amu.

00:15:48.060 --> 00:15:52.420
Hikaru-kun? Why are you here?

00:15:52.420 --> 00:15:58.180
My eraser ran out, so while I was going to the local
stationery store to buy a new one, I noticed you.

00:16:00.230 --> 00:16:01.950
A limousine to buy...

00:16:01.950 --> 00:16:03.230
...an eraser?

00:16:03.450 --> 00:16:05.620
Hey, it's been a while!

00:16:05.620 --> 00:16:07.850
Oh yes, we met before,
didn't we?

00:16:07.850 --> 00:16:10.280
Let's play together!

00:16:12.320 --> 00:16:14.660
'cause you let your guard down!

00:16:14.660 --> 00:16:16.470
Ami, what are you doing?

00:16:16.470 --> 00:16:18.600
I'm sorry, Hikaru-kun...

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:21.040
Ami...

00:16:22.410 --> 00:16:23.500
Run away!

00:16:23.790 --> 00:16:25.190
Why, you...

00:16:25.190 --> 00:16:26.480
Let's do it, Hikaru-kun!

00:16:26.480 --> 00:16:27.170
Yeah!

00:16:27.170 --> 00:16:28.980
Take that!

00:16:28.980 --> 00:16:30.830
Here, this one's yours,
Hikaru-kun.

00:16:34.680 --> 00:16:37.550
Ami, you're on!

00:16:51.620 --> 00:16:53.190
I'm beat...

00:16:53.670 --> 00:16:55.810
That was fun!

00:17:00.250 --> 00:17:03.000
I need to go buy that eraser.

00:17:03.000 --> 00:17:05.080
Sorry about that, Hikaru-kun.

00:17:05.080 --> 00:17:07.140
I sort of got you caught
up in this.

00:17:07.140 --> 00:17:08.250
I care not.

00:17:09.340 --> 00:17:17.800
I have studied that children in ordinary
families play meaningless games.

00:17:17.800 --> 00:17:19.900
I see...

00:17:21.310 --> 00:17:23.680
Hikaru-kun never changes,
does he?

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:25.190
I guess.

00:17:25.190 --> 00:17:27.640
But maybe we overdid it.

00:17:27.080 --> 00:17:28.550
<i>Growl~</i>

00:17:28.550 --> 00:17:32.240
Sis, I'm hungry!

00:17:32.240 --> 00:17:33.400
Again?

00:17:33.400 --> 00:17:35.570
It's already dinner time.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.950
Time for my revenge!

00:17:41.280 --> 00:17:43.500
Su makes a comeback!

00:17:43.500 --> 00:17:46.290
Character Change!

00:17:52.970 --> 00:17:55.090
My curry rice has
been completed!

00:17:55.370 --> 00:17:57.240
Yay!

00:17:57.240 --> 00:18:00.610
Curry rice?  Kind of basic.

00:18:05.390 --> 00:18:07.060
So, Ami?

00:18:08.990 --> 00:18:11.980
Very delicious!

00:18:12.560 --> 00:18:15.130
Good going, Su! Your revenge
was a success!

00:18:15.130 --> 00:18:17.120
Congratulations, that's our Su!

00:18:17.120 --> 00:18:20.390
My training bore fruit!

00:18:20.390 --> 00:18:22.250
What training?

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.700
You do know that I'm the one
who actually made it, right?

00:18:27.430 --> 00:18:27.960
Ami?

00:18:30.010 --> 00:18:33.590
Maybe she got the chills from
being covered in water?

00:18:33.590 --> 00:18:36.400
Then let's warm up in the
bath right away!

00:18:41.790 --> 00:18:44.610
Hey! Don't waste the water!

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:52.430
She's stolen your special
move, Amu-chan.

00:18:52.430 --> 00:18:54.730
Enough... I'm beat...

00:18:55.080 --> 00:18:58.610
Cheer up, Mother Amu-chan!

00:18:58.610 --> 00:19:00.290
What are you talking about?

00:19:00.290 --> 00:19:03.960
All I did was get run around
by Ami-chan all day.

00:19:04.660 --> 00:19:07.110
Oh yeah! I have to
do my homework!

00:19:07.110 --> 00:19:08.480
Amu-chan!

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:11.290
Ami-chan's face is all red!

00:19:13.730 --> 00:19:15.360
Ami?

00:19:15.360 --> 00:19:16.930
Oh, no!

00:19:16.930 --> 00:19:18.960
Amu-chan, hurry, hurry!

00:19:18.960 --> 00:19:20.460
Which one is the cold medicine?

00:19:20.460 --> 00:19:22.750
I don't know!

00:19:24.360 --> 00:19:25.880
Oh, it's from Mom!

00:19:26.410 --> 00:19:30.310
"Sorry, but Mom and Dad are
gonna be later than we thought."

00:19:31.190 --> 00:19:34.150
What should I do?

00:19:32.620 --> 00:19:37.050
Shh! I can't sleep!

00:19:37.240 --> 00:19:38.400
Ami?

00:19:39.690 --> 00:19:40.610
Huh?

00:19:40.610 --> 00:19:41.740
It's not hot...

00:19:42.470 --> 00:19:44.550
So it's not a cold?

00:19:44.550 --> 00:19:49.770
Maybe her face was red from staying
in the bath too long?

00:19:49.770 --> 00:19:52.950
And she passed out from
playing too much.

00:19:54.250 --> 00:19:56.190
Sheesh...

00:19:58.690 --> 00:20:00.890
Mom...

00:20:04.880 --> 00:20:09.200
Mom, I love you!

00:20:18.690 --> 00:20:20.270
"Mom," huh?

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.950
We're home!

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:33.570
It's really gotten late.

00:20:33.570 --> 00:20:36.320
I hope those two are okay.

00:20:38.330 --> 00:20:41.170
Amu-chan, I'm coming in.

00:20:53.080 --> 00:20:55.270
Look at the sleeping cuties!

00:21:00.390 --> 00:21:04.640
Then I sprayed water in
her face like "splash!"

00:21:04.640 --> 00:21:07.070
Oh? Sounds like you had fun.

00:21:07.070 --> 00:21:07.850
Yeah!

00:21:07.850 --> 00:21:12.160
I looooove my big sister!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:16.520
I wished I could have
played with you.

00:21:16.520 --> 00:21:17.130
Huh?

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:19.420
Where's Amu-chan?

00:21:19.420 --> 00:21:21.720
I'm never gonna make it!

00:21:21.720 --> 00:21:23.170
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:21:23.170 --> 00:21:26.760
Thanks to Ami I didn't do any
of my homework at all!

00:21:27.070 --> 00:21:29.220
Oh no, Amu-chan!

00:21:29.220 --> 00:21:31.020
It's already time to go to school.

00:21:32.370 --> 00:21:34.260
You can do it, Amu-chan!

00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:36.960
Fight on, Mother Amu-chan!

00:21:36.960 --> 00:21:38.400
Argh!

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:41.770
Being Mom sucks!

00:21:43.890 --> 00:21:45.720
Guardian Egg Fortune Telling!

00:21:46.160 --> 00:21:49.180
Choose one of the four eggs!

00:21:51.590 --> 00:21:54.150
Which eggs will be
the lucky ones?

00:21:57.960 --> 00:22:00.100
Guardian Egg Studying Fortune!

00:22:00.100 --> 00:22:02.210
First, for those of you who
chose Miki's egg...

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.950
Four Shugoluck Stars,
Super Lucky!

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:06.950
Your hard work will pay off!

00:22:06.950 --> 00:22:10.750
Your teachers and family
might praise you!

00:22:11.220 --> 00:22:12.150
If you chose Su's Egg...

00:22:12.150 --> 00:22:13.140
Three Shugoluck Stars!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.730
You'll be able to concentrate
no problem!

00:22:13.140 --> 00:22:14.730
Try attacking the parts you have trouble
with! You might be able to solve them!

00:22:15.060 --> 00:22:16.130
If you chose Dia's Egg...

00:22:16.130 --> 00:22:17.070
Two Shugoluck Stars!

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:19.980
They'll help you advance your studies!

00:22:17.070 --> 00:22:20.280
Sweets will pick you right up!

00:22:20.900 --> 00:22:23.480
And finally, for those of you
who chose Ran's egg...

00:22:23.480 --> 00:22:26.570
You get, um... one
Shugoluck Star.

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:31.270
Your concentration will go down, and
you might lose your favorite eraser!

00:22:26.570 --> 00:22:34.470
Your lucky item is a calender!

00:22:31.270 --> 00:22:34.770
Check to make sure you
have everything, 'kay?

00:22:38.170 --> 00:22:40.050
Today sure was fun, wasn't it?

00:22:40.750 --> 00:22:43.340
See you for the next
Shugo Chara Party!

00:22:43.340 --> 00:22:46.770
Lock On: Open Heart!

00:22:47.300 --> 00:22:49.340
Bye-bye!

00:22:51.640 --> 00:22:58.050
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!

00:23:13.550 --> 00:23:18.710
Let's put our hands together for you! Yes, you!

00:23:18.710 --> 00:23:22.590
Let's put our hands together!
That's what I wanna do!

00:23:25.140 --> 00:23:30.290
Now put your hands together for me! Yes, me!

00:23:30.290 --> 00:23:34.100
Now put your hands together!
It's what you should do!

00:23:34.700 --> 00:23:40.080
When I first heard your big dream,

00:23:40.080 --> 00:23:45.480
it was like I was whisked away to another place!

00:23:46.340 --> 00:23:52.690
So, I only know a tiny sliver of the world,

00:23:52.690 --> 00:23:56.780
but at least you're here to talk to me.

00:23:56.780 --> 00:24:02.840
Hey! When I saw that look, that serious attitude...

00:24:02.840 --> 00:24:09.100
Before I knew it, my heart was all aflutter!

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:10.190
Bravo!

00:24:10.840 --> 00:24:14.650
C-L-A-P! C-L-A-P!
